1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:02,369
The crude metal is called spelter.

2
00:00:02,369 --> 00:00:06,080
The fine powder that condenses first is zinc dust.

3
00:00:06,080 --> 00:00:15,065
Spelter is refined by liquation, by fractional distillation, or electrolytically to ninety nine point nine five percent.

